              },
              {
                "to": "menu"
              }
            ]
          },
          "hello": {
            "text": [
              "Ledger. I sell the guns and the BBs and I buy back what the losers drop.",
              "The belt is a replica. Do not tell Knuckles I said that."
            ],
            "do": {
              "set": "met"
            },
            "then": "menu"
          },
          "menu": {
            "text": "Buying or selling?",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "Show me the book.",
                "do": {
                  "shop": true
                },
                "to": "after"
              },
              {
                "text": "Any tips?",
                "to": "tips"
              },
              {
                "text": "Not today.",
                "to": "end"
              }
            ]
          },
          "after": {
            "text": "Pleasure. Try not to bleed on the counter.",
            "then": "end"
          },
          "tips": {
            "text": [
              "Tiny stands still. Vex circles. Knuckles comes straight at you.",
              "Shoot the one that is coming. Holster when you are down to two hearts. Stitch charges more than I do."
            ],
            "then": "menu"
          }
        },
        "greetings": {
          "acquaintance": [
            "Book is open. Odds on Knuckles are short, odds on you are whatever I feel like.",
            "Bought back a hammer off somebody who came in with two and left with none. That is the kind of arithmetic I do.",
            "Vex has been circling the cage for an hour. She circles when there is nobody in it, too.",
            "The belt is still on the shelf at fifteen hundred. Still a replica. Still the most looked-at thing in the building."
          ],
          "friend": [
            "Stitch says you owe him. I say you owe me first. He can have what is left when the BBs are paid for.",
            "You floor all three and the house pays out. I am the house. So understand that my tips come with a small conflict of interest.",
            "Tiny asked what you are like. I said you shoot the one that is coming. He looked worried. Tiny does not look worried.",
            "Somebody dropped a sword in the cage and did not come back for it. I priced it. You will like the price less than I did."
          ],
          "close": [
            "Counter is clean. Keep it that way, and if you cannot, bleed on my side, I have the cloth.",
            "Real odds, since it is you. Knuckles two to one. Vex evens. Tiny does not lose and I do not take money on him.",
            "Told Knuckles the belt is real. I lie to him, not you. That is the difference between a customer and whatever you are."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
